         fhir:equivalence [ fhir:v "equivalent" ] ;
         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element matches Basic element path `Basic.meta` (`Resource.meta`), use that element instead.\nElement `NutritionIntake.meta` is not mapped to FHIR R4, since FHIR R5 `NutritionIntake` is not mapped.\nElement `NutritionIntake.meta` has no mapping targets in FHIR R4. Typically, this is because the element has been added (is a new element)." ]
